# Serena is edited from a Linux laptop and a Windows PC that share one working
# tree over Syncthing. Without this, a file written on Windows comes back with
# CRLF, which turns every later diff into a whole-file rewrite and, worse, makes
# shell scripts unrunnable: `#!/usr/bin/env bash\r` fails with
# "/usr/bin/env: 'bash\r': No such file or directory".
#
# It happened on 2026-08-30 and took the host-restart helper with it.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.onnx binary
*.bin binary
*.pyc binary
*.AppImage binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pfx binary
